# Normalise line endings in the repository.
#
# The working tree on Windows/OneDrive was checking every file out as CRLF while
# the repository stores LF, so `git status` reported all 251 tracked files as
# modified — 49,422 insertions against 49,422 deletions with not one real change
# in them. That buries genuine work and makes every diff unreviewable.
#
# `text=auto` tells git to store LF and convert on checkout per platform, which
# is the setting that should have been here from the first commit. Pair it with
# `git config core.fileMode false` locally: the same mount also flips 644 to 755.
* text=auto

# Binary — never touch these.
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif binary
*.ico binary
*.pdf binary
*.kmz binary
*.node binary
*.woff binary
*.woff2 binary

# Generated: collapse in diffs and exclude from language stats.
pnpm-lock.yaml linguist-generated=true -diff
